      "title": "Student Sales Coordinator WORKSTUDY",
      "description": "University of the Incarnate Word - Cardinal Talent | Student Sales Coordinator WORKSTUDY Skip to Main Content Cardinal Talent Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help UIW Home UIW Strategic Priorities Visit UIW Student Sales Coordinator WORKSTUDY Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. None. Position Details Position Information Position Title Student Sales Coordinator WORKSTUDY Academic Year 2026-2027 UIW Mission University of the Incarnate Word is a Catholic institution that welcomes to its community persons of diverse backgrounds, in the belief that their respectful interaction advances the discovery of truth, mutual understanding, self-realization, and the common good. Position Summary The Student Sales Coordinator must be able to work in a team environment to handle sales inquiries both online, over the phone and in person. Sales coordinators must be familiar with regulations and policies to serve as liaisons for clients. The Student Sales Coordinator reports to the Sales Manager. Essential Functions Duties include: Answering phone, processing payments, client interaction and follow up, etc. Must be proficient with all Microsoft Office programs. Must display strong customer service and communication skills both written and verbal. Must be able to work as a team. Must have good organization and planning skills. Business Casual attire is required due to the constant interaction with clients outside of the University. Qualifications Knowledge Skills and Abilities Microsoft office. Strong Customer Service Skills. Strong attention to details. Ability to work in a team environment. Ability to work efficiently with individuals from diverse backgrounds and communities. Employee shall adhere to all applicable rules and regulations of the University, the Conference, and the NCAA . Required Education Current UIW undergrad students only. Required Work E