    "https://jobs.uiw.edu/postings/30900": {
      "title": "Senior Resident Assistant",
      "description": "University of the Incarnate Word - Cardinal Talent | Senior Resident Assistant Skip to Main Content Cardinal Talent Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help UIW Home UIW Strategic Priorities Visit UIW Senior Resident Assistant Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Senior Resident Assistant Academic Year 2026-2027 UIW Mission University of the Incarnate Word is a Catholic institution that welcomes to its community persons of diverse backgrounds, in the belief that their respectful interaction advances the discovery of truth, mutual understanding, self-realization, and the common good. Position Summary The Senior Resident Assistant ( SRA ) position is a student leader role responsible for providing support and assistance to RLHO Administrators within a housing community comprised of one or more residence hall buildings. This student has been a Resident Assistant and wishes to promote a positive living & learning environment. The Senior Resident Assistant ( SRA ) reports to a Residence Life Coordinator. Essential Functions Participate in (i) role modeling for student staff, (ii) Department training sessions, (iii) advertising & promoting residential culture, (iv) on-call crisis response rotation, (v) troubleshooting resident connection concerns, (vi) operations & programming follow-through. Senior Resident Assistant Adhere to all Resident Assistant (RA) expectations & duties Access to upkeep platforms such as Social Media, Housing Inbox, StarRez (limited) Assist with residential experience (program execution, maintenance follow-up, tours) Contribute to Administrative projects & sustainability efforts Assist with department processes, data entry & review, weekly staff meetings, department initiatives & collaboration, serve on weekday/weekend/holiday on-call rotation, and office duties as assigned. Perform other duties as assigned. Qualifications