      "description": "University of the Incarnate Word - Cardinal Talent | Skyroom Operations Management GA Skip to Main Content Cardinal Talent Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help UIW Home UIW Strategic Priorities Visit UIW Skyroom Operations Management GA Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. None. Position Details Position Information Position Title Skyroom Operations Management GA Academic Year 2026-2027 UIW Mission University of the Incarnate Word is a Catholic institution that welcomes to its community persons of diverse backgrounds, in the belief that their respectful interaction advances the discovery of truth, mutual understanding, self-realization, and the common good. Position Summary The Operations Management GA for Rosenberg Skyroom will serve in the Skyroom Operations Office and in the Skyroom for events, handling operations of events or meetings that take place in the Rosenberg Skyroom. The Operations Management GA for Rosenberg Skyroom reports to The Skyroom Operations Manager. Essential Functions Set up, operate, and break down Skyroom Events. Set up, operate, and break down AV Equipment for Skyroom Events. Client follow-up on Diagrams, Timelines, Vendor Lists, Signage, and Media for AV. Create Diagrams, Timelines, Vendor Lists, and Signage. Perform other duties as assigned. Qualifications Knowledge Skills and Abilities Knowledgeable in Microsoft Office Strong written and verbal communication skills. Strong Customer Service Skills. Ability to work in a team environment. Ability to work efficiently with individuals from diverse backgrounds and communities. Employee shall adhere to all applicable rules and regulations of the University, the Conference, and the NCAA . Required Education Currently Enrolled as a UIW Graduate Student. Required Work Experience None Preferred Qualifications None Required Certifications, Licenses or Registrations None Work Hours Varied hours Monday – Friday Varied hours Sat – Sunday Must be available to work Weekdays & Weekends, Daytime & Evenings Physical Demands Ability to move tables and chairs, as needed. Ability to lift up to 50 lbs. Posting Details Posting Details Posting Number STU1582PO Number of Vacancies 1 Job Type Part Time Job Category Students Desired Start Date 06/01/2026 Multi-Hire Pool No Position End Date (if temporary) Reports to Skyroom Operations Manager Salary Tuition Waiver only Open Date 05/06/2026 Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicant None. EOE UIW is committed to a policy of equal opportunity in employment, without regard to race, color, sex, sexual orientation, citizenship status, national origin, age, marital status, disability, genetic information, gender identity or expression, veteran status, pregnancy, and religion (except in limited circumstances when religious preference is both permitted by law and deemed appropriate as a matter of University policy). Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Cover Letter/Letter of Application Student Class Schedule Optional Documents Other Document Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you a UIW Graduate student? Yes No Applied - Awaiting Acceptance * What is the major of your Graduate Degree? (Open Ended Question) 4301 Broadway, San Antonio, Texas 78209 210-829-6000 • 1-800-749-WORD Back to top © 2019. University of the Incarnate Word. All rights reserved. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
